# AWS Priority Queue Processing with SNS, SQS, Lambda and CloudFormation

## Project Overview

This project implements a priority-based message processing system using AWS CloudFormation, Amazon SNS, Amazon SQS and AWS Lambda.

Messages are published to a central SNS topic with a priority attribute. SNS subscription filter policies route messages to the appropriate SQS queue. A Lambda function checks the high-priority queue first and processes messages from the low-priority queue only when no high-priority messages are available.

